; resize_zero_cols: RESIZE with a non-positive extent must raise.
;
; ISA.md already names InvalidGridDimensions for rows or cols <= 0. The
; Rust VM enforced it; xqvm_py assigned unconditionally and left the model
; with a degenerate grid, which is how a grid reaches the state ONEHOTR
; and ONEHOTC now reject.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0

PUSH 2           ; rows
PUSH 0           ; cols
RESIZE r0
HALT
